  "title": "Jello Poke Cake",
  "description": "This Jello poke cake made with strawberry Jello has a creamy topping for a pleasing dessert that's always a hit! Use any flavor of Jello you like.",
  "authors": [
    "mollie"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-04-26T21:16:41-04:00",
