  "ingredients": [
    "1 (15.25 ounce) package yellow cake mix",
    "1 cup water",
    "3 eggs",
    "0.33333334326744 cup vegetable oil",
    "0.25 cup cold water",
    "1 (3 ounce) package strawberry-flavored gelatin mix (such as Jell-O®)",
    "1 cup boiling water",
    "1 (8 ounce) container whipped topping (such as Cool Whip®)"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients, preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C), and grease a 9x13-inch baking pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/B3MYQg5grIcw1O3J3ExgmOt1bwU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-273112-jell-o-poke-cake-VAT-4x3-step-01-4d31d5830c054aabb4a3fdb4edf8009c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/273112/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine cake mix, water, eggs, and oil in a large bowl; beat with an electric mixer on low speed until moistened. Increase speed to medium and beat for 2 minutes. Pour batter into the prepared baking pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/B3Uq1T_qq3YyMtjbEUFRLKGi8vY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-273112-jell-o-poke-cake-VAT-4x3-step-03-a98e8b24b2464ab88098e332e3ec7f84.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/273112/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until a toothpick inserted into the center comes out clean, 24 to 29 minutes. Let cool completely, at least 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/GjhPZoe1IivUQt7w-A0Kx7qiyN0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-273112-jell-o-poke-cake-VAT-4x3-step-04-c81d077f0ff7469984e8c0e45f58c392.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/273112/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour cold water into a bowl. Sprinkle gelatin mix on top. Let stand until softened, about 1 minute. Add boiling water and stir constantly until granules are completely dissolved.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/wZ9nkkjAVVfE8BzD2dhfo1Rwgn0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-273112-jell-o-poke-cake-VAT-4x3-step-05-5c3c8b4d3cfb4a5589ae9f4c7df9e77d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/273112/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Poke holes all over the cake using a skewer or a fork; pour gelatin mix into the holes. Refrigerate cake until gelatin is set, about 1 hour or up to 6 hours.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/vkcEN5dv7JlpqhiMQVsk0W8X0Rc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-273112-jell-o-poke-cake-VAT-4x3-step-06-a0d0bd911bc34222bd469ade3274ca2b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/273112/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread whipped topping over cake.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/96rDJdCYAtkHDa-2vQjMUgktEq8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-273112-jell-o-poke-cake-VAT-4x3-step-07-6db1aa75a85f4726b4dff01f4bd20b09.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/273112/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/G7CWUr-80kbtkDnC6o61HzwBtcU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-273112-jell-o-poke-cake-VAT-hero-4x3-94aeb567b7fa492a80edbfd7cf77c2c4.jpg"
      ],
